      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 44,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n5z0c",
          "name": "Doc Title",
          "fill": "#2B141C",
          "content": "LS-67 多寶貝 Profile · Handoff Notes",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 26,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qAEBK",
          "name": "Doc Sub",
          "fill": "#7A3B48",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "R1（首輪，未經 visual-reviewer）。三畫面群：建檔（08）／管理（09/09b/09c）／切換（10/10b/10c）。依賴 LS-46 定稿語彙與 LS-66 R1 後端語意裁決。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "TihIt",
          "name": "N 建檔（08）",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            10,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UzOlh",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "#2B141C",
              "content": "建檔（08）",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "TnBAv",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Q6JZL6",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 08",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uN7hM",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "三欄位表單：頭像（可選）／姓名或暱稱（必填）／生日（必填，用來算年齡與排時間軸）。可整頁跳過，跳過後從「管理」（09）補建，文案不強迫長輩馬上填完。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "FCseO",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EsTc3",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 08",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jkz6B",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "頭像選擇器是 88pt 圓形點擊區（遠大於 44pt 下限），camera icon＋文字標籤「新增照片」；生日欄位是一個 tappable row（icon＋值＋chevron），實作串接原生日期選擇器（wheel/.sheet 皆可），稿面只表達觸發點與已選值的排版。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "yKKh3",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Plhd3",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 08 AX3",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pVuZN",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "生日欄位在 AX3 從單行橫排改為可換行：Field Box 拿掉固定 height:60 改 fit_content，Field Value 加 textGrowth:fixed-width，否則「2024年3月12日」在 40pt 下會橫向溢出裁切。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "P4SgQ",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "D3FUG",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 08-iPad",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "adBnT",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "不對稱版式跟 01/04-iPad 同語彙，但左欄大頭貼放大到 160pt 且就是「新增照片」按鈕本尊（不是裝飾照片）——這張畫面的唯一任務就是選照片，讓左欄承載真正的任務比放一張無關的情境照片更誠實。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
