                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 09",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eCYJA",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "寶貝清單卡沿用 07b 待核准卡片的視覺語彙（$surface/$border/$radius-lg＋分隔線），刻意不是沖印品——角托三段規則第③段：會被整理／刪除的清單不是收藏品，角托只留給家人的照片本身。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "HT57W",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eE58m",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 09",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "I9NxSu",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "每列＝cmp/Child Avatar（姓名縮寫圓）＋姓名＋年齡膠囊（cmp/Pill, icon:cake）＋兩個文字動作「編輯」「移除這個寶貝」。Owner 檢視兩個都在；Member 檢視只隱藏「移除」，其餘不變——本輪未另出 member 稿，差異只記在這裡（見「未決」E1）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "cyhJr",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CnPE7",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 09 空狀態",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BNnRb",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "空清單卡改置中訊息（icon:image-off＋標題＋引導文案），不是破圖佔位符。刻意示範：即使 0 位在案寶貝，仍可能有 1 位「已移除的寶貝」可展開——對應 LS-66 R1 後端裁決：軟刪除的寶貝仍可解析，不會憑空消失。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "DZzDt",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "o39hK",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R1 · 09c",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Oo4K5",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "刪除確認做成 bottom sheet（scrim＋卡片）而非原生 .alert：文案要完整交代 30 天可還原＋照片與日記保留，原生 alert 塞不下這麼長的說明。確認鈕是外框＋danger 色（不是實心）——沿用 07b「重新產生邀請碼」的既有語彙（danger 不做主鍵）。ios-dev 可以用 .sheet／.confirmationDialog 自訂樣式實作，稿面給的是文案與資訊架構，容器彈性由實作決定。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
