                  "id": "g3gpna",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N2",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RJdpC",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AX3-08／08-iPad仍是R3改版前的副標「之後隨時可以在家庭頁修改，現在不填也沒關係。」（4個變體只改了2個，AX3/iPad漏改）。已同步為「填好基本資料，就能開始記錄他的成長了。」，4個變體現在一致。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "T8drF",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dpy4T",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N3",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MM3wn",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "cmp/Tab Bar的Label用$fs-meta，在AX3主題下解析到約33pt／單行48pt高，元件原本64pt高＋22pt icon是為預設字級設計，AX3下icon溢出膠囊上緣4pt、label溢出下緣4pt，且label(99pt寬)比它的分段(85.8pt)寬，最左邊「時間軸」的label左緣穿出膠囊左邊界。改法只動AX3-10這一個實例（不動元件本身，10/10b/10深仍是預設字級不受影響）：4個Label改enabled:false、4個Icon放大到48×48（icon-lg AX3階），變成「只有icon」的AX3降級版本——這正是本票R2 Handoff Notes就寫好的既有解法（icon＋accessibilityLabel），這次真的做到稿面上而不只是文字承諾。SwiftUI實作時4個icon仍需搭配accessibilityLabel（時間軸/相簿/寶貝/設定），本稿的Pencil限制無法標註，寫在這裡供ios-dev對照。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "j185W",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hqGZI",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N4",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "J4iwm",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AX3-10新增的Photo Print是Copy自「10」的c9EwP，連同已經算好的染料池opacity（.386/.255/.270/.180）一起複製過去，但AX3-10這張印品實際位置(24,331)與尺寸(345×359)跟「10」的(24,344,345,268)不同，opacity沒有重算。已用同一套lit()公式重算：TL.392 TR.258 BL.236 BR.155——與 reviewer 預測值逐位吻合。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
